00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.070
We're going to a baseball game, but it's the Giants vs. Yokohama!

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:36.320
If I had a choice, I'd much rather see the Carps play!

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:40.830
We might even meet some celebrities in Tokyo!

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.830
Like Sakurai Honoka... I'd love to meet her!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.210
Sakurai Honoka?

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.170
That's cool. I want to meet her too!

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.380
Akari, we're finally on the same wavelength!

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.840
Everyone, line up here, line up!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:06.390
Cars are numbered from 16, 15 in the front to 1 in the rear. The Green Car is...

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.850
I'm going to Tokyo.

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:10.350
A school trip?

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.770
Really? When?

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:14.860
Next week. We'll be staying for three days and two nights.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.070
I see. That's great!

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:22.160
You'll be in the area!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.370
Tohto University

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.370
Yeah.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:25.330
By the way...

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.750
Could we... meet up?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.250
I-It's fine if we do it after classes are over!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.880
I'm free until five, you know.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.340
I'll go to meet you nearby.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.850
Also, I have something for you.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.430
Okay.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.980
Really? Seriously?

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:48.850
Yeah.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:52.480
So, what is it?

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.190
You'll see when the time comes.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.230
But...

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.780
But meeting her again won't be easy.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:05.790
Hey, are you listening at all?

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.080
I am, I am!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.290
Are you really?

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.790
Tokyo

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.790
Reserved

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.050
<i>But, even if it's just a short encounter,</i>

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.340
<i>I still want to meet you.</i>

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:28.720
"When I look at her face, I feel like I am becoming more beautiful as well.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:37.360
When I think of her, my mind is overwhelmed with a sense of exaltation.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.570
Meet Haruto
at 3 pm

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:41.860
If the mysterious thing called love really exists..."

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.000
Eba arrived a bit late,

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.340
Kannae Movers

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:00.550
bringing spring with her.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.590
I'm from Tokyo. My name is Eba Yuzuki.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.850
Nice to meet you!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.310
<i>I tried to prepare for her arrival,</i>

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.570
<i>but she exceeded all expectations.</i>

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:18.860
Damn!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.190
Why is this happening to me?

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.120
Why did she come to a high school at the end of the world?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.870
And she's mooching off of us even though we're not related!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.250
Haruto!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:38.630
Your mom wants you to come down for tea.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.970
She didn't just bring spring. She brought the spring storms with her too.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.390
<i>The strong wind blinded me,</i>

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:55.600
<i>and I had no choice but to accept the change of seasons.</i>

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:01.480
Like I said, I don't know how to ride a bike.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.740
Amazing! It's so fast!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.660
You'll bite your tongue if you keep talking.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.870
This is so fun!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.830
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.660
It's fun!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.090
The air is so fresh...

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.220
The sky is so nice too...

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.350
I'm speeding up!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:40.690
<i>We weren't lovers back then...</i>

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.320
<i>But we lived in the same house.</i>

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.460
<i>We spent our time together every single day.</i>

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.600
<i>We were close enough</i>

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.480
<i>to hold hands all the time.</i>

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.030
<i>But then...</i>

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.610
There's something I want to show you.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.330
Ice flowers!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.870
So beautiful!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.840
I wanted to show you after it was cold enough.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:46.800
I'm glad I could.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.180
Thanks.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:54.390
Even when I'm back in Tokyo, I'll never forget.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.390
Don't go back to Tokyo.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.810
Stay here with me, please.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.570
Don't go back.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.860
Just stay here with me.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.830
Listen up!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:21.960
We're going to the Tokyo Dome to watch a baseball game,

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.130
but we're ahead of schedule,

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.840
so when we get there, you'll have some free time.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:30.510
But only an hour!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.840
Be at the entrance by 5 PM!

