00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.240
And...

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.370
Um...

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.120
Kanzaki?

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.630
Would you...

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:39.010
be my boyfriend?

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:50.930
"By their nature, women are more satisfied than men

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:57.940
Revenge for yesterday

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:58.690
when they are at the center of attention, even if it is unjustified,

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:01.950
as opposed to merely being in a normal relationship.

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:11.960
It is often said that the hearts of men and women cannot mesh perfectly."

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:18.460
We should totally meet today.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:24.470
We should totally
meet today.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:24.050
I'm going there at three.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:19.340
We should totally
meet today.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.480
Sorry.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.480
Kirishima!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.240
Would you... be my boyfriend?

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.530
Your boyfriend?

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.160
That's not what I mean! Just act like it.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.370
What do you mean?

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:54.670
I have a friend who moved here after elementary school.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:13:00.050
When I told her we'd be free on our second day, she wanted to meet me.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.840
And what does that have to do with me pretending to be your boyfriend?

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.380
Because, well,

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:10.560
she's always bragging about her kind and cool boyfriend!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:16.060
So I told her that I have a boyfriend too...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.360
And she told me to bring him tomorrow...

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.320
But why do I have to do it? You could ask Takashi...

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.570
It doesn't matter who it is!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.570
It's just an act!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.200
What?

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:31.700
Just...

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.160
Does it bother you so much?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.830
No, it's just, you know...

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.340
I promised to meet Eba at three.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:48.840
Lunchtime service
Until 2 pm

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.510
It's okay. I told my friend we had to leave at two.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.550
I see. Then it's okay.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:56.350
Homemade food restaurant

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:53.520
But while she's here, act like you're really my boyfriend!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.980
I'll do what I can.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.770
U-Um...

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.190
What?

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:04.940
Nothing...

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:06.860
But you know,

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.280
why are there so many people here in the middle of a weekday?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.370
Tokyo people have so much time.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.710
Let me introduce you. She's Koga—

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:24.130
Haruno! Nice to meet you!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.630
You're her boyfriend?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.300
I'm Kirishima Haruto.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.930
Aren't <i>you</i> cool?

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:37.980
Don't worry. I won't steal Nanami's boyfriend.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.150
I... I didn't think you would!

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.650
How long have you been going out?

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.990
How long ago has it been?

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:54.160
It's kinda hard to remember when it started.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.250
He confessed to me during the summer festival,

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.250
but I didn't answer right away.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.680
You didn't agree right away?

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.140
Well, you <i>are</i> a late bloomer.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.270
Yeah, I guess.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.870
Sorry for making you wait.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.370
I've made my decision.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.500
I think...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.380
I think you and...

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.510
Haruto!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:55.970
It's Yuzuki!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:07.480
But we watched the fireworks together,

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.280
and that's when I realized...

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:14.490
That's nice, that's nice!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:18.490
And it's so romantic to confess under the fireworks!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.790
So, when did you tell him?

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.500
Um, sometime around the school fair, I think.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:31.130
We were doing a café for the fair, and we used our apples.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.510
You know, the apples my family was growing.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.680
Then on the way back home...

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:42.560
Have you rejected me because of Eba?

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.600
I see...

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.980
Why did you decide to agree?

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:54.740
But, I...

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:55.530
It's okay.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:59.330
I've completely given up.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:03.040
But, I'd like to still be friends.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.540
No—

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.790
Can I ask just one thing, though?

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:09.790
That's...

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:15.050
Please don't tell Eba about this.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:22.140
She might not want to stay if she heard.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.980
She came to the countryside all alone,

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.690
I'd feel sorry for her...

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.400
But...

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:36.280
I kinda gave in to his single-minded passion for me.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.450
Are you making fun of me?!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:45.790
He had this crush on me since middle school.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:48.790
Why...

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:58.680
Why do you always choose her instead of me?

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.180
So I thought, why not?

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:06.980
Eh, you liked Nanami all along?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.440
My family's running a specialty restaurant!

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.030
Drop by when you're free!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.700
It's awesome!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:30.960
I've...

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.210
...loved Kanzaki...

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.220
I've loved Kanzaki all along!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.730
...all along.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.740
So, she returned your love after all those years then.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:58.530
I guess.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.870
Let's just be friends.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.160
Kind of.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.500
Then you've made out, right?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.050
You're all lovey-dovey, aren't you?

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.710
Of course...

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.470
How suspicious.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:25.100
You're still calling each other by your family names.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.810
Are you really going out?

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.520
What are you implying?!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.020
Of course we are, right, Kanzaki?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:35.320
Kanzaki?

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.820
Yeah! We're going out! We're making out too!

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:47.330
Hey, let's play with Teddie!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:55.340
Come on, we're in a restaurant!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.550
You guys are cute together, though.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.100
See you later then! Text me sometime.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.390
Yeah. You too.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:18.980
At least grope her tits.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.650
You're totally not used to it.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.950
She totally knows, doesn't she?

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.870
I tried...

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.630
This is more like what lovers would do, isn't it?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:48.930
I'm your boyfriend until this train leaves.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:13.910
Eba...

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.580
Haruto...

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.920
14:37 For Shibuya & Shinagawa
Train arriving

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:27.800
I can't.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:51.620
Feelings change.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.450
But...

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.960
They really do.

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:03.460
You loved Nanami so much until just recently.

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:10.260
Feelings change.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:16.180
I can't do this anymore.

