at
Twilight
1

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:34.200
Crossing at Twilight 1

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:47.550
Rushing to me at the crossing at twilight

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:55.390
That feeling that I want to see you

00:22:56.100 --> 00:23:02.270
Like the clouds swimming in the sky

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:09.570
Meeting, melting and disappearing

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:17.580
For a while we've been ignoring each other

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:21.210
But to be honest I'm still

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:28.670
seeking only you

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:32.260
My wish to see you

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.390
is eternally painted in the sky

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:39.600
See, today again it's all so

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:42.730
dazzling and lovely

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:45.820
Standing in a sunny place,

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:50.400
like a blooming sunflower,

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:56.780
I keep looking at my shining love.
